P(X \geq 8) = P(X = 8) + P(X = 9) + P(X = 10) = \binom{10}{8} \cdot (0.5)^{10} + \binom{10}{9} \cdot (0.5)^{10} + \binom{10}{10} \cdot (0.5)^{10}
\]
Calculating each term, we get \[
P(X = 8) = \binom{10}{8} \cdot (0.5)^{10} = 45 \cdot (0.5)^{10} = 45 \cdot \frac{1}{1024} = \frac{45}{1024}
