\] \[
P(X = 10) = \binom{10}{10} \cdot (0.5)^{10} = 1 \cdot (0.5)^{10} = 1 \cdot \frac{1}{1024} = \frac{1}{1024}
\] Adding these probabilities together, we get \[
P(X \geq 8) = \frac{45}{1024} + \frac{10}{1024} + \frac{1}{1024} = \frac{56}{1024} = \frac{7}{128}
\]
